      "locked": false,
      "text": "\"What's the weather in Mumbai right now?\"\n-> geocodeCity(\"Mumbai\")        [OpenAPI target]\n-> getCurrentWeather(19.07, 72.88)  [Lambda target]\n\"Mumbai now: 26.9\u00b0C (feels 30.9\u00b0C),\n humidity 84%, wind 14 km/h.\"\n\nnew session, next day would work too:\nmemory recalled the city AND the\nshort-answers preference (v0.6 stack intact)",
