      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REMEMBER:\n1. tools are infrastructure now \u2014 catalog, credentials and policies live at the gateway; agent code is just the loop + memory\n2. two target flavors, one gateway: describe an API (OpenAPI spec) or write 15 lines (Lambda) \u2014 mix freely\n3. our gateway has NO inbound auth (demo!) \u2014 add CUSTOM_JWT or IAM before any real traffic",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REMEMBER:\n1. tools are infrastructure now \u2014 catalog, credentials and policies live at the gateway; agent code is just the loop + memory\n2. two target flavors, one gateway: describe an API (OpenAPI spec) or write 15 lines (Lambda) \u2014 mix freely\n3. our gateway has NO inbound auth (demo!) \u2014 add CUSTOM_JWT or IAM before any real traffic",
